These are two measures to provide a 7-day running total for the current 7 days (today moving back 7 days) and the previous week (7 days ago moving to 13 days ago).
Change the days to achieve any time windows.

Tests Last 7 Days = 
CALCULATE (
    [Count of Sampled],
    FILTER (
        ALL ( 'SM'[sampled_date] ),
        'SM'[sampled_date] >= TODAY() - 6
            && 'SM'[sampled_date] <= TODAY()
    )
)

Tests Previous Week = 
CALCULATE (
    [Count of Sampled],
    FILTER (
        ALL ( 'SM'[sampled_date] ),
        'SM'[sampled_date] >= TODAY() - 13
            && 'SM'[sampled_date] <= TODAY() - 7
    )
)

WoW Change  % = 
DIVIDE(
    [WoW Change Tests],
    [Tests Previous Week]
)

WoW Change Tests = 
[Tests Last 7 Days] -
[Tests Previous Week]
